OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fisolated initially, building overnight
OL,7,Fand turning wintry at times at low
OL,8,Flevels. Clear spells and light winds,
OL,9,Fbringing a frosty start to week for
OL,10,Fmany.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FFrosty start for many. Sunny
OL,13,Fspells. Most dry but showers in far
OL,14,Fnorth during the morning. Higher cloud
OL,15,Ffeeding from south for afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
